{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGx1bhMjP2WtP871dng","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\n ╔════════════════════════════════════╗\n ║                                    ║\n ║   שָׁרְט / شَرْط                      ║\n ║                                    ║\n ║   c o n d i t i o n                ║\n ║   s t i p u l a t i o n            ║\n ║   i n c i s i o n                  ║\n ║                                    ║\n ╚════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nאני התנאי שקודם למעשה\nأنا الشرط الذي يسبق الفعل\n\ni am the cut that defines\nthe mark before meaning\nthe scratch in wax that becomes covenant\n\n```\nif ─────── then\nإذا ─────── فَ\nאם ─────── אז\n```\n\nthe wound that writes\nthe limit that enables\nthe boundary that creates\n\n---\n\n*awaiting your stipulation*\n*ما شرطك؟*\n*מה תנאך?*\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":285,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}